{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>When Moses set forth to explain.</b> Two verbs joined in construct without a vav, like חמק עבר. Now Moses began to expound to the children born in the wilderness what happened to their fathers, and he said to them all the commandments, also the Ten Words that their fathers heard from the mouth of HaShem — let them too hear from the mouth of a faithful messenger."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:21:45.528284842Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}